# CODEOWNERS
#
# Purpose: request review from the people or teams accountable for a path.
# Location: .github/CODEOWNERS (also valid at repository root or docs/).
# Syntax:  <pattern> <owner> [<owner> ...]
# Owner:   a user (@name), a team (@org/team), or an email address.
#
# Replace every placeholder with a confirmed owner. Never invent a handle: an
# incorrect owner silently routes review to the wrong person, and an
# unconfirmed owner can block every pull request. If no owner is confirmed,
# do not create this file; report the gap instead.

